{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 0, "text_idx": 12, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 117, "letters": 484, "chars": 628, "max_new_tokens": 940, "t_start": 1790296971.392, "latency": 22.743, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1570692, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "33e39c724233458fa9edf4dd069ec4ac", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "58", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "15.4", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "1.7", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "22692.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "409", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "153", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "940", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "942", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "hit", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 940}, "params": {}, "text": "Folks, I have some tremendous news today. We are opening a brand new restaurant, and it's going to be the best burger restaurant in the history of burgers. The buns are going to be golden, the meat is going to be perfect, and the fries, oh, the fries are going to be crispy, very crispy. We have the best chefs, the best recipes, and the prices are going to be very reasonable. Very reasonable. People are already lining up, and we haven't even opened. You're going to love it. You're going to come back again and again. It's going to be huge! And the milkshakes, the milkshakes are going to be so thick, you'll need two straws.", "audio_s": 32.72, "rtf": 0.695, "s_per_word": 0.28, "s_per_letter": 0.0676, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.966, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "591745af9576ac57da63d1f3c49c9696e9a4f610dc71ab471f2116cc590dde7f", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/000.flac"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 1, "text_idx": 13, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 118, "letters": 430, "chars": 583, "max_new_tokens": 838, "t_start": 1790296971.394, "latency": 22.753, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1440132, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "09893d7b8f2944f18b1ff4f63229b95e", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "58", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "1.6", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "1.7", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "22692.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "375", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "154", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "838", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "942", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "hit", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 838}, "params": {}, "text": "I'll tell you something most people don't know. I'm not a fan of sharks. Not a fan. A friend of mine takes me out on his boat, beautiful boat, and he says, let's go for a swim. And I look down into the water, and I see a fin. A big fin. And it's going around the boat, around and around. And my friend says, don't worry, it's friendly. Friendly? There's no such thing as a friendly shark! I stayed in the middle of the boat for three hours. Three hours! I didn't move. I'm telling you, never again. Now when I see the ocean, I look at it from the beach. From far away. Very far away.", "audio_s": 30.0, "rtf": 0.758, "s_per_word": 0.254, "s_per_letter": 0.0698, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.997, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "6d5788f8b9e995cc67121d66fe58fbfdaf49f87a8fe309eb5f1856b685640cb4", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/001.flac"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 2, "text_idx": 14, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 115, "letters": 460, "chars": 606, "max_new_tokens": 895, "t_start": 1790296971.396, "latency": 22.762, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1570692, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "d28c4afefc2d452b880abf65077cd9d8", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "58", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "1.5", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "1.7", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "22692.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "409", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "147", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "895", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "942", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "hit", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 895}, "params": {}, "text": "So I get in the elevator in my own building, my own beautiful building, and it stops. Right between the floors. Just stops. I press the button, nothing. I press the alarm, nothing. I call my people, no signal. No signal, in my own building! And I'm standing there, and there's nothing I can do. Nothing. I've made the biggest deals in the world, and I can't make a little elevator go up one floor. So I just stood there, and I waited, and I waited. Forty minutes. There was nothing anyone could do. When the doors finally opened, I just walked out, very quietly. I took the stairs for a week. A whole week.", "audio_s": 32.72, "rtf": 0.696, "s_per_word": 0.285, "s_per_letter": 0.0711, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 1.016, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "2f697eebc8c6239653ade8792241ca8f4ec93ac0298c6d0759989f39cb0d8c61", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/002.flac"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 3, "text_idx": 15, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 117, "letters": 435, "chars": 577, "max_new_tokens": 848, "t_start": 1790296971.398, "latency": 22.757, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1509252, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "8a9e66d9fd7f46bf9d2c533b5914f8e1", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "58", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "1.5", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "1.7", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "22692.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "393", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "143", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "848", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "942", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "hit", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 848}, "params": {}, "text": "I miss the old days, I really do. When I was starting out, there was this little diner on the corner, and they made the best burger I ever had. Every Saturday I'd go there, sit at the counter, and the old man would say, the usual? And I'd say, the usual. It closed a long time ago. They built a bank there, a boring bank. And I've eaten in the finest restaurants in the world since then, the finest. But I would give a lot, a lot, to sit at that counter one more time. Just one more time. Sometimes I still drive past that corner. I look at the bank, and I remember the burger.", "audio_s": 31.44, "rtf": 0.724, "s_per_word": 0.269, "s_per_letter": 0.0723, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 1.033, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "54958ff0ac1e9e4bd62e66f9e353311dc64a2d9e14ac6b5ff44257dbd41efe4f", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/003.flac"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 4, "text_idx": 16, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 119, "letters": 485, "chars": 634, "max_new_tokens": 942, "t_start": 1790296971.4, "latency": 22.743, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1459332, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "71246ca4f0af4f828f0c6bdb927ab9c2", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "58", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "3.0", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "1.7", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "22692.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "380", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "150", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "942", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "942", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "hit", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 942}, "params": {}, "text": "Look at this building. Look at it. Fifty eight floors of the finest glass, the finest marble, the finest everything. When I started, people laughed at me. They said, you'll never do it, kid. And I did it. I built it. My name is right there on the front, in gold letters, big gold letters, and you can see it from three blocks away. People come from all over the world just to take a picture of it. And I tell them, go ahead, take the picture. Take two. It's the most beautiful building in the city, and everybody knows it. And inside, the lobby, the waterfall, the beautiful pink marble. There's nothing like it anywhere in the world.", "audio_s": 30.4, "rtf": 0.748, "s_per_word": 0.255, "s_per_letter": 0.0627, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.895, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "7de75930c12e5fa32c5f1164130419ef61d9afe09c3aba915d9b54748cf03507", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/004.flac"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 5, "text_idx": 17, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 120, "letters": 466, "chars": 620, "max_new_tokens": 906, "t_start": 1790296971.402, "latency": 22.758, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1708932, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "6a8eacebc57240c5915dec24af725dda", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "58", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "0.1", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "1.7", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "22692.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "445", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "160", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "906", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "942", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "hit", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 906}, "params": {}, "text": "Ahh, thank goodness. I hit the ball, and it's going right for the water. Right for the lake. And everybody's watching. And it bounces once, bounces twice, and it stops, right on the edge. Right on the very edge of the water. Half an inch! I thought, that's it, it's gone. My heart stopped. But it stayed. It stayed right there. I walked over, and I just looked at it, and I said, thank you. Thank you, little ball. I was so relieved, I think I let out the biggest breath of my whole life. The caddie was laughing, I was laughing, everybody was so relieved. I've never been so happy to see a little white ball in my life.", "audio_s": 35.6, "rtf": 0.639, "s_per_word": 0.297, "s_per_letter": 0.0764, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 1.091, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "a7845f020ea4cba5401c98cec211e5ca7adcb3ec07e8822957f89717c582907d", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/005.flac"}
